| **DIET:** | Omnivore |
| **INTELLIGENCE:** | Genius (17-18) |
| **TREASURE:** | R |
| **ALIGNMENT:** | Lawful neutral |
| **NO. APPEARING:** | 1 (1-6) |
| **ARMOR CLASS:** | 5 (3) |
